{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：10:40 2026-11-11 HKT<br/>發佈時間：10:40 2026-11-11 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：10:40 2026-11-11 HKT</p><p>11月10日，貴州黔西南興義。昨日（10日），貴州黔西南興義發生一宗驚險事件。一名身穿紅衣的幼童，整個人竟然懸掛在高層住宅的窗戶外，雙手緊緊捉著窗框邊緣，雙腳完全懸空，隨時有墮樓的危險。</p><img alt=\"小孩當時雙手緊抓窗邊保命。百姓關注\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/397d5ae586182d8add1dfab750386ca8/2026-11/LhCmT62cgx08CfTilXnG01041200bCOF0E010_mp4_snapshot_00_01__2026_11_11_09_55_02_.jpg\"/><img alt=\"小孩當時雙手緊抓窗邊保命。百姓關注\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b3b2fe56565e77fb3e7f05133c85f23a/2026-11/LhCmT62cgx08CfTilXnG01041200bCOF0E010_mp4_snapshot_00_07__2026_11_11_09_55_10_.jpg\"/><img alt=\"小孩當時雙手緊抓窗邊保命。百姓關注\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ed675eee3869b0eb5f9d8ba0d214e0b4/2026-11/LhCmT62cgx08CfTilXnG01041200bCOF0E010_mp4_snapshot_00_08__2026_11_11_09_55_14_.jpg\"/><img alt=\"小孩當時雙手緊抓窗邊保命。百姓關注\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4e863f463e8976e80b1bcc02be0ee12f/2026-11/LhCmT62cgx08CfTilXnG01041200bCOF0E010_mp4_snapshot_00_12__2026_11_11_09_55_21_.jpg\"/><img alt=\"小孩當時雙手緊抓窗邊保命。百姓關注\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8f8337300f56f3fa0b2ad07fadc31e10/2026-11/LhCmT62cgx08CfTilXnG01041200bCOF0E010_mp4_snapshot_00_13__2026_11_11_09_55_26_.jpg\"/><img alt=\"小孩當時雙手緊抓窗邊保命。百姓關注\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ca401cbf0f2c6966af39776e89c4fa39/2026-11/LhCmT62cgx08CfTilXnG01041200bCOF0E010_mp4_snapshot_00_15__2026_11_11_09_55_30_.jpg\"/><p>幸好有人窗內伸出一雙手，一把將孩子拉回了室內，避免悲劇發生。整個過程由同屋苑業主拍下，不過事後仍猶有餘悸：「看到我腿都軟了。」</p><p>影片在網上瘋傳，不少網民亦留言：<br/>查找小本：有驚無險，但不能次次都靠運氣<br/>嗚啦啦啦725：看得手心冒汗<br/>吃完這頓就減肥拉：一瞬間的疏忽，就可能造成終身遺憾</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T02:51:00.084482+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":318,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T02:40:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T07:07:51.373911+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T02:44:34.511977+00:00","content_hash":"712ebaec1ea83be024395975dd27a7e1f3667a3544f175dd2b4bf1757632122d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}